Package: challengeci
Title: Shared Plumbing for Ecological Forecasting Challenge CI
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Quinn", "Thomas", , "rqthomas@vt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions used by the GitHub Actions workflows that run an
    Ecological Forecasting Initiative forecasting challenge: reading and
    validating the challenge configuration, connecting to S3 stores, reading
    site metadata, and (in later versions) processing submissions, bundling,
    scoring, baselines and the STAC catalog. Every challenge-specific setting
    comes from 'challenge_configuration.yaml'. The package lives inside the
    challenge repository and is loaded with pkgload::load_all() so the code a
    workflow runs always matches the commit it checked out.
